{"id":"se","lemma":"se","pos":"pron","rank":17,"glosses":["A reflexive or reciprocal pronoun: oneself, himself, herself, itself, yourself; themselves; yourselves; each other; one another","A pronoun used with transitive verbs to create the passive voice","A pronoun used with a verb conjugated in the third-person singular to convey an impersonal meaning"],"ipa":"/se/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/83/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-se.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Se me escucha?","en":"Do you read me?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1187384","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"listening"}]},{"text":"¿Se te ha ido la pelota?","en":"Have you gone nuts?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636584","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"away with the fairies"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"ball"}]},{"text":"¿Qué se te da bien?","en":"What're you good at?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1062269","words":[{"g":"what"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"well"}]},{"text":"¡Se me ha vuelto a dormir el pie!","en":"My foot's asleep again!","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/50855","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"change"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to sleep"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"foot"}]},{"text":"Yo hice que él se fuera.","en":"I made him go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440333","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"outside, out"}]}]}